---
import DocumentLayout from '../layouts/DocumentLayout.astro';
import { APP_STORE_URL } from '../consts';

const sections = [
  { id: 'v1-0-4', label: 'Version 1.0.4' },
  { id: 'v1-0-3', label: 'Version 1.0.3' },
  { id: 'v1-0-2', label: 'Version 1.0.2' },
  { id: 'v1-0-1', label: 'Version 1.0.1' },
];
---
<DocumentLayout title="Changelog" eyebrow="DiskPress changelog" heading="What's new in DiskPress" description="Release notes for DiskPress, the native Mac utility for compressing and deduplicating the files you want to keep." sections={sections}>
  <section id="v1-0-4" class="changelog-release">
    <div class="changelog-release-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p><h2>DiskPress v1.0.4</h2><p class="fine"><time datetime="2026-09-24">September 24, 2026</time></p><p>Faster compression, smarter CPU use, and smoother handling of active files.</p></div>
    <ul class="changelog-list">
      <li>Lower memory use for large-folder optimizations.</li>
      <li>Faster deduplication by reusing the results of the current scan.</li>
      <li>Live file counts make duplicate-discovery progress easier to follow.</li>
      <li>Cancelling deduplication preserves work already completed.</li>
      <li>Corrected savings for overlapping saved folders, including parent and child folders.</li>
      <li>More reliable handling when files change or disappear mid-optimization.</li>
      <li>Quicker compression when processing several files in one folder.</li>
      <li>Fastest mode adapts to the Mac's available performance cores.</li>
      <li>Low CPU mode limits sustained processor load on large files.</li>
      <li>Database files and their journals are now excluded by default.</li>
      <li>Edits from other apps are preserved with fewer unnecessary recovery prompts.</li>
      <li>Unreadable or read-only files are skipped without needless attention alerts.</li>
      <li>Corrected savings accounting when access to saved folders is refreshed mid-optimization.</li>
      <li>File group editing is unavailable when every group is already excluded.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine">Based on the <a href={APP_STORE_URL}>Mac App Store</a> release notes.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="v1-0-3" class="changelog-release">
    <div class="changelog-release-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p><h2>DiskPress v1.0.3</h2><p class="fine"><time datetime="2026-09-23">September 23, 2026</time></p><p>Lower memory use, faster deduplication, and clearer progress.</p></div>
    <ul class="changelog-list">
      <li>Optimizing large folders now uses less memory.</li>
      <li>Duplicate checks run faster by carrying scan findings through the same optimization.</li>
      <li>Duplicate discovery now shows live file counts and clearer progress.</li>
      <li>Cancelling deduplication is smoother and keeps work that has already finished.</li>
      <li>Corrected savings calculations for overlapping saved locations, such as a folder and one of its subfolders.</li>
      <li>More reliable processing when a file is modified or removed during an optimization.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine">Based on the <a href={APP_STORE_URL}>Mac App Store</a> release notes.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="v1-0-2" class="changelog-release">
    <div class="changelog-release-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p><h2>DiskPress v1.0.2</h2><p class="fine"><time datetime="2026-09-21">September 21, 2026</time></p><p>Faster repeat optimizations, more control, and smoother background operation.</p></div>
    <ul class="changelog-list">
      <li>Faster repeat optimizations with cached duplicate checks and compression results.</li>
      <li>Added the option to skip deduplication during an optimization.</li>
      <li>Saved locations can now wait until a linked app is closed before optimizing.</li>
      <li>Automatic monitoring stays enabled across restarts and starts quietly at login.</li>
      <li>DiskPress can stay in the menu bar for manual optimization with monitoring off.</li>
      <li>Fixed conflicting monitoring statuses and menu actions.</li>
      <li>Clearer progress reporting, including file counts and explanations between stages.</li>
      <li>Fixed cases where progress became inaccessible or appeared stuck.</li>
      <li>Savings rescans no longer compete with active optimization.</li>
      <li>Added Ukrainian, Chinese, Spanish, and German localizations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine">Release notes from the <a href={APP_STORE_URL}>Mac App Store</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="v1-0-1" class="changelog-release">
    <div class="changelog-release-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p><h2>DiskPress v1.0.1</h2><p>More compatibility, safer recovery, clearer measurements, and smoother everyday control.</p></div>
    <ul class="changelog-list">
      <li>Added support for macOS 27 Golden Gate.</li>
      <li>Added a Linked App option for saved locations. Optimization skips these locations while the selected app is running, including manual, automatic, and CLI operations.</li>
      <li>Fixed Show Progress becoming unavailable during automatic optimization and transitions between stages.</li>
      <li>Improved switching to menu bar mode and handling repeated Close or Quit commands.</li>
      <li>Fixed a sandbox permissions issue that incorrectly skipped eligible files with <code>File metadata cannot be preserved</code>.</li>
      <li>Improved automatic recovery so affected files can be preserved and skipped while other files continue optimizing.</li>
      <li>Fixed a persistent recovery loop involving tiny files that already used no allocated storage.</li>
      <li>Preserved last known location sizes and savings when a rescan cannot finish, instead of displaying zero. Temporary scan failures now retry automatically.</li>
      <li>Excluded DiskPress temporary and recovery files from savings measurements.</li>
      <li>Updated CLI statistics to include linked apps and distinguish outdated measurements from missing data.</li>
      <li>Added the Storage Saver Duo bundle link to Help &amp; About and updated the App Archiver tile with its app icon.</li>
      <li>Improved Locations table sizing and column alignment. Optimization titles and subtitles now stay vertically centered beside the app logo.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</DocumentLayout>
